<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Guwahati to Bangalore | Express Container Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the car transport from Guwahati to Bangalore typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 2,704 km is usually covered in 5‑7 business days, depending on road conditions, weather, and any mandatory checkpoints along NH 44 and NH 33. Our live GPS tracking lets you monitor progress in real time, ensuring accurate arrival estimates.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for RTO clearance during the Guwahati‑to‑Bangalore vehicle shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original registration certificate, a valid insurance policy, a signed transport agreement, the e‑Way bill generated for interstate movement, and a copy of your PAN or GSTIN if the shipment is for corporate reimbursement. Our team assists in preparing and filing each document.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system guarantee zero scratches on my car?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp features a low‑angle, non‑slip surface that aligns perfectly with the vehicle’s undercarriage. Trained technicians position the car on cushioned rollers, engage the ramp, and secure it with a 4‑wheel lock. This method eliminates manual lifting, preventing contact damage and ensuring a scratch‑free transport.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the car transport service and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment includes IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural disasters during the entire Guwahati‑to‑Bangalore journey. Any claim is processed swiftly with full documentation from our side.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the Guwahati to Bangalore transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to a secure portal. You receive a unique tracking link after pickup, allowing you to view the route, estimated arrival, and any stoppages in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of car transport from Guwahati to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is affected by vehicle size, weight, and any special handling requirements such as extra padding for luxury cars. Distance, fuel surcharge, insurance coverage, and seasonal demand also play roles. Our transparent cost table breaks down each element so you understand the final quote.</p>
      </div>
